artifacts:
  - $route/2.1.scenario.enumeration.from.imagination.yield.md

reviews:
  self:
    - slug: has-cant-miss-branches
      say: |
        did you include the low-probability / high-severity landmines, or only
        the likely causes? a missed can't-miss branch defeats the whole method
        (rule.require.superposition-until-elimination).
    - slug: has-mechanism-per-scenario
      say: |
        does each scenario carry a one-line causal chain (cause:exposure ->
        cause:mechanism -> effect:mechanism -> effect:symptom)? a scenario with
        no mechanism cannot be assayed later.
    - slug: has-no-premature-weights
      say: |
        did you rank or weight any scenario here? this stone is the lineup only.
        weights belong to phase 3 (disentangle).
